<blockquote>
Utopia
</blockquote>
<br>
<blockquote>
The hanging tree is hung

in a righteous land.

Its ropes moor dreams 

to a busy wharf.
</blockquote>
<br>
<blockquote>
The axe is buried.

The stone is slung and forgot.

The song is sung.
</blockquote>
<br>
<blockquote>
The knife is not bloody

in a golden realm.

The knife cuts each child down

a bright balloon.
</blockquote>
<br>
<blockquote>
Antillo, 2843.
</blockquote>
